      "id": 80119,
      "name": "Envisioner",
      "username": "Envisioner",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-10-29T22:01:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But just give it to Haka, he loves that kind of stuff from Ambuscade, haven't you seen them frolicking at the the theme park?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is probably sarcasm, just to make sure the OP knows.&nbsp; Granted, Haka has an immense amount of HP, but he takes +1 damage from Ambuscade due to the nemesis rule, and also deals +1 damage to Ambuscade for the same reason.&nbsp; So depending on who else is out, you <em>might</em> want Haka to absorb the hits, but it equally well might not be a good idea.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:02:07.922Z",
