      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-10-29T22:06:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Everybody is tied for the most number of cards (0) so it's heroes' choice.But just give it to Haka, he loves that kind of stuff from Ambuscade, haven't you seen them frolicking at the the theme park?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is a bit of a misconception. Your Character cards count as cards in play. So everyone is tied for 1. It's important to make that clear to prevent future trouble.&nbsp;</p>",
